WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.180
Read the month's timesheet, print one person's, and send overtime and absences to the draft payroll.

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.160
Timesheets shows the month for everyone.

3
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:17.340
Shift days, present, late, absent, leave, hours worked against the schedule, overtime and punctuality.

4
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.170
Choose another month, a department, or the order.

5
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:25.070
Export downloads the same figures as a spreadsheet.

6
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:29.320
Open someone to see their days.

7
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:37.010
Print the timesheet opens the month as a sheet to print and sign, in English or Arabic.

8
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:41.430
At the end of the month, send it to payroll.

9
00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.490
Choose Send to payroll.

10
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:51.300
First a preview: each person's overtime hours and pay, and absences that become unpaid days.

11
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.830
Apply changes only a draft payroll. Bonuses and deductions you typed stay as they are.
